# Fixed ids for every user that owns files on /data: the files keep their
# owner across system updates. Buildroot gives automatic ids from 100 to
# 999, in an order that can change between images, so fixed ids live above
# that range, from 1000. Images up to 0.17.0 picked them automatically;
# S00storage gives the files back at boot.
#   pedalboard  the app, /data/pedalboard
#   chrony      the time daemon, /data/var/lib/chrony (as in package/chrony)
pedalboard 1000 pedalboard 1000 * /data/pedalboard /bin/sh audio,video,render,input,gpio,netdev Pedalboard
chrony 1001 chrony 1001 * /run/chrony - - Time daemon
